---
---
<section class="editorial-section">
  <div class="editorial-container">
    <div class="editorial-header">
      <span class="editorial-eyebrow">The Atelier Heritage</span>
      <h2 class="editorial-title">Poetry in Gold & Gems</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <div class="editorial-card">
        <h3 class="card-title">Ancient Polki</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Uncut diamonds preserved in their raw, luminous grandeur—set in handcrafted 14kt gold frameworks that honor centuries-old Indian goldsmithing traditions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="editorial-card">
        <h3 class="card-title">Carved Botanicals</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Intricately sculpted tanzanite and vibrant emeralds, reflecting flora and natural motifs found across historic Bombay courtyards and royal archives.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="editorial-card">
        <h3 class="card-title">Bespoke Commission</h3>
        <p class="card-desc">
          Every Carpe Diam creation is singular. Our master artisans in Bombay work intimately with collectors to craft heirloom pieces designed for generations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .editorial-section {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-darker);
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem) var(--spacing-header-x);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .editorial-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .editorial-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .editorial-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .editorial-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3.4rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-text-white);
  }

  .editorial-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }

  .editorial-card {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-gold-light);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .card-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
